          "boundary": "One actual canonical snd pullback M and bounded conditional mean T are chosen before every rough L2 input under the SAME Gibbs/Gaussian laws. PM=M, MT=AM, true AE source-S mean, contraction, AE fiber L1/squareL1 and integrated variance=||BMu||²=||u||²-||Tu||² are proved internally. Original C2/two-sided Hessian/capped step retained; finite Hilbert/Borel/rank0 explicitly extends the source Euclidean setting. No every-y rough integrability/C1, gradient/H1/B13, Gamma/dynamics/main/errors/unbounded-cost or actual-input composition claim.",
